Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.84,0:00:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.78,0:00:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the village of Windnight's Lot, nestled\Nin a valley and ringed by daunting cliffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.88,0:00:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A castle dominates the landscape,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.26,0:00:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,built in the Middle Ages as\Na proving ground for knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It houses prisoners who toil underground,\Nmining coal as pennants for their crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fishing and farming provide\Nsustenance and commerce alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five hundred and seventeen souls\Ncall the sleepy bird their home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.82,0:00:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how few shall remain\Nwhen the carnage is done?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.02,0:00:47.15,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sora! Koboreochita futatsu no hoshi ga
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.02,0:00:47.15,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Two stars fall from the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.02,0:00:47.15,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sora koboreochita futatsu no hoshi ga
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.24,0:00:54.83,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hikari to yami no minamo suikomareteyuku
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.24,0:00:54.83,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,One shining in the light, the other sinking into darkness
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.83,0:01:00.25,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hikiau you ni kasanaru hamon
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.83,0:01:00.25,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,A ripple drawing the two of them together
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.67,0:01:11.30,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hokori no michi wo yuku mono ni taiyo no michibiki wo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.67,0:01:11.30,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,One will walk the path of pride and receive the sun's guidance
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.67,0:01:11.30,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hokori no michi wo yuku mono ni taiyou no michibiki wo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for listening.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.30,0:01:17.43,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yabou no hate wo mezasu mono ni
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.30,0:01:17.43,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,One will walk the path of unbridled ambition...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.43,0:01:19.02,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ikenie wo!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.43,0:01:19.02,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Demanding sacrifice!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.43,0:01:19.02,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ikenie wo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.69,0:01:29.57,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Furueru hodo kokoro moetsukiru hodo atsuku
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.69,0:01:29.57,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Let that burning in your soul calm the trembling of your heart
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.57,0:01:32.91,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sono te kara hanate kodou
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.57,0:01:32.91,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Strike down your fears,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.91,0:01:36.37,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Karada minagiru yuki de
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.91,0:01:36.37,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,With courage coursing through your veins!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.91,0:01:36.37,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Karada minagiru yuuki de
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.37,0:01:43.08,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mayoi naki kakugo ni kassai wo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.37,0:01:43.08,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,You cannot overcome your pain unless you can accept...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.37,0:01:43.08,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mayou naki kakugo ni kassai wo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.08,0:01:47.05,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sono chi no sadame!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.08,0:01:47.05,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,The legacy of your bloodline!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.08,0:01:47.05,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sono chi no sadame
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.05,0:01:50.84,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,JoJo!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.05,0:01:50.84,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinoto!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.98,0:02:07.98,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\pos(1285,825)\bord3.5\blur2}Episode 5: "The Dark Knights"
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.98,0:02:07.98,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\pos(1285,825)}Episode 5: "The Black Knights"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.72,0:02:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farmers sing to the harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.00,0:02:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thus far, all is well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.16,0:02:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, Dio lurks in the\Nshadows waiting to strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.60,0:02:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.24,0:02:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Speedwagon has been begging\Nme to share in your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.70,0:02:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I meant to help him create\Njust a little bit of harmone,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.80,0:02:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as I did that first day with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.82,0:02:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems I was too rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.68,0:02:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did my finger slip?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.20,0:02:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Un miliai, you're discusi,\Nmy dear Speedwagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.28,0:02:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In English, please!
