Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.72,0:02:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,El culprit is a lad, it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.82,0:02:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His crime was well planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.52,0:02:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I salute the boy's ingenuity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.46,0:02:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come you two are heaping\Npraise on that little imp?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.60,0:03:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's making off with every\Npound we have to our names.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.24,0:03:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oi, bring it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.04,0:03:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, he took our money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.44,0:03:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But think how he might be able to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.26,0:03:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.17,0:03:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A guide who knows the lay of\Nthe land would not be unwelcome.
