Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.30,0:03:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, that was a nice diminuendo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.96,0:04:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your overdrive passed through\Nthe rocks as smooth as silk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.02,0:04:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think I struck\Nthe right spot, Baron?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, but a couple of paces\Nto the left should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two pounds says I'm right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.38,0:04:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.29,0:04:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It shocked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Molto Bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.24,0:04:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.26,0:04:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you holding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.90,0:04:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lad, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.34,0:04:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The force shouldn't have\Nhurt you that badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.46,0:04:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I use too much hormone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.48,0:04:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd guess we were meant to give chase\Nwhen he took our bag. Look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.58,0:04:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.10,0:04:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no accident that we now find\Nourselves held by these restless cadavers,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.82,0:04:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our young thief, he was hypnotized and made\Nto lure us here. There, Jojo! It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.74,0:04:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.02,0:05:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun is gone.
