Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.36,0:05:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are they crawling out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.70,0:05:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been trying to steal my spine\Nleading up to this little tete-a-tete,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.50,0:05:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's like the Grim Reaper's\Nbreathing down me neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.22,0:05:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all a sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.62,0:05:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to find my courage when\Nthat monster's staring right at us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir Joestar loved him, and all he\Ngot for his troubles was death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.96,0:05:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.36,0:05:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Dio Brando.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He and his minions have no power to\Nattack us while we stand in the daylight,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.62,0:05:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but here in a field of\Ndarkness and carrion?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.28,0:05:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He thinks us easy prey\Nripe for the taking at any
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,moment a creature of such\Nguile must not have the mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.96,0:05:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow we will purge\Nthe world of this evil.
