Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.80,0:06:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do they call you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.96,0:06:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poco?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.87,0:06:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Poco, hang on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.46,0:06:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.88,0:06:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, this way! Lead on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.18,0:06:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoom punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.96,0:06:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio Brando.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.66,0:06:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo and Speedwagon have told me much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.64,0:06:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the mask that allows you to act\Nout your evil heart, I say only this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time, I break you.
