Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.38,0:06:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, bambino!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.70,0:06:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's easy to be cocky when you're\Nup there out of harm's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.80,0:06:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.08,0:06:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dare to address me thus, insect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.18,0:06:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, the pinnacle of creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.40,0:07:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To mere humans, I am like unto a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.62,0:07:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why would I cavort down\Nin the filth with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.44,0:07:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me almost knocked me off my\Nfeet with a blast of pure hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.34,0:07:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Already this Dio has the soul of a tyrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.24,0:07:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of the scars from my\Nbattle with Jojo have healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.02,0:07:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All save this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.10,0:07:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, Charlatan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.66,0:07:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relinquish your blood, that I\Nmay erase this imperfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.10,0:07:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, to undo your injuries, how\Nmany innocent lives did you consume?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.92,0:07:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.88,0:07:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many loaves of bread have\Nyou eaten in your lifetime?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.48,0:07:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.72,0:07:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will take him home!
