Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.58,0:08:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His Hormone is moving its way up Diozor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.54,0:08:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider this an eclipse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.22,0:08:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.74,0:08:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's freezing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.48,0:08:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's simple, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.48,0:08:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For Hamon to work, blood must flow\Nthrough this arm with which you hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.12,0:08:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I froze the very blood in your veins,\Nrendering your attack powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.46,0:08:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have mastery of my body in ways\Nthat you can't even begin to dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.40,0:08:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I just vaporized\Nthe moisture in my left arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.98,0:08:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The force of it pulled in\Nall heat in the immediate
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.58,0:08:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,area freezing your arm\Nin the process and now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.90,0:09:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for the coup de grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.58,0:09:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This punch is going to shatter your\Narm and your skull like a windowpane!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.10,0:09:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.62,0:09:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ending your reign\Nof terror here and now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.88,0:09:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your blood I can feel the\Nevil coursing through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.72,0:09:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.24,0:09:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to set me all a-tremble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Masterful block by the by.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.30,0:09:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the moment, your mentor lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you had it in you. Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.82,0:09:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, if you keep cutting in like\Nthis, I'm liable to lose my temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.56,0:09:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.60,0:09:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's useless! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.22,0:09:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can see, by freezing my arm,\Nyour puny attack had nowhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.46,0:09:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think Hamon will save\Nyou, you are sorely mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.24,0:09:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His strength is like\Nnothing I've ever witnessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.42,0:09:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This fiend is our equal many times over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.40,0:10:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, he's about to freeze\NJojo's arm, just like mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.00,0:10:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come what may, I can't\Nlet harm before the lad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.68,0:10:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Barron Zeppeli!
