Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.42,0:10:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tor, this ain't happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.00,0:10:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hand's cold as ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.00,0:10:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every nerve is crying out in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.26,0:10:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The skin on my fingers is peeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.22,0:10:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He removed the moisture.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.66,0:10:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Baron's arm is in a pretty bad way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.14,0:10:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gangrene will take it if we\Ndon't get the blood flowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.04,0:10:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Homo's the only weapon in our arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.32,0:10:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do we stand against him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.60,0:10:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So anemic, this parlor trick of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.18,0:10:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should save your breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.48,0:10:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it an earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to need that air for all\Nthe screaming I have in store for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.12,0:11:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tarkus! Blueford!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.18,0:11:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arise and fight at my command!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.62,0:11:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let their cries of anguish resound,\Nso that all may know my glory!
