Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.62,0:11:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poco, get to safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.14,0:11:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are knights,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.74,0:11:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,casualties of Queen Elizabeth's fatal\Nmachinations in the mid-1500s against Mary,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.60,0:11:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Queen of Scotland.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.04,0:11:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heed me well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.40,0:11:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I find these humans vexing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.48,0:11:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I order you to destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.26,0:11:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I care not how.
