Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me I'm dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.18,0:12:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That big one broke the\Nboulder with a single finger!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.90,0:12:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are waiting for Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's their main target.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a warrior, but he\Ncan't handle both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.14,0:12:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only my blood would\Nstart moving a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.90,0:12:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what, Baron?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.18,0:12:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I could heal my arm\Na little with Harmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to thaw\Nthis damnable thing in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.70,0:12:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's heat you need, Speedwagon's\Nfeeling right charitable this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.80,0:12:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.71,0:12:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you have a plan, then?
