Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.60,0:12:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heard they treat frostbite in\Nthe arctic by cutting open a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.82,0:12:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seal and sticking the frozen hand\Na foot into the poor blighter!
