Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.64,0:13:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speedwagon, you don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.16,0:13:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all due respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be buggered before I let harm come\Nto you or Jojo while I can lend a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.80,0:13:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he can drink my blood through this,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.78,0:13:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then perhaps it will serve as a\Nconduit for my hormone as well.
