Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.90,0:13:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.14,0:13:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have I already lost too much vitality\Nto make my hormone effective?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.90,0:13:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may have sold you short, Amico.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.40,0:13:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you would run\Nwhen things got truly dire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.76,0:13:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me despiace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.10,0:13:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baron, if we live through this,\Nyou and me are right as rain.
