Dialogue: 3,0:14:01.32,0:14:01.36,SFXYellow3,20.3,0,0,0,,{=46}{\bord0\blur1\pos(57.579,16.084)\alpha&HFF&\alpha&H00&\t(59,60,\alpha&HFF&)\frz5.56\org(57.579,16.084)\4a&HFF&}Menacing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.54,0:14:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can read people like a book, and\Nthese two are full-a-story speed wagon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.92,0:14:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't want to hear, thank you kindly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.50,0:14:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be honored to perish at the\Nhands of these men, Tarkus and Bluford.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.36,0:14:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bow to my will, O warriors of yore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.04,0:14:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the mid-16th century, two women\Nwaged war for the Crown of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.28,0:14:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the cunning Queen Elizabeth I, a Tudor,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.66,0:14:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the beautiful Mary\NStuart, Queen of Scots.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.16,0:14:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The most steadfast of her vassals were\Nthe great knights Tarkus and Bluford.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.90,0:14:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They had lost their families, without a\Npurpose to center them, a raison d 'etre.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.82,0:14:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were adrift.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.18,0:14:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dutiful man seeks respite,\Nnot in the vagaries of romance,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.28,0:14:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but in something larger and ineffable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.72,0:14:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In Mary they found just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.94,0:14:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They swore to serve and honor the young\Nqueen, even at the cost of their own lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.12,0:14:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But one day, Mary's husband,\NLord Darnley, was found murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.98,0:15:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing a chance to strike, Elizabeth\Nblamed Mary for Darnley's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.84,0:15:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people turned against Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.14,0:15:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was caught and imprisoned\Nin a series of castles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.16,0:15:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tarkus and Bluford fought like\Nlions to free their queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.02,0:15:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So fearsome were they, Elizabeth\Napproached them with a bargain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.22,0:15:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surrender and bring an\Nend to this bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.74,0:15:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grant us but this one thing\Nand we will spare Mary's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.46,0:15:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If our lives can buy the\NQueen her freedom, I accept!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.96,0:15:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.02,0:15:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They went to Elizabeth\Nand sealed their fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.46,0:15:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you're so selfless, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.48,0:15:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're losing\Nyour hands for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.20,0:15:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your precious Mary's already worm food?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.92,0:15:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, take a look over by that\Nwall if you're having your doubts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.68,0:15:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so royal now, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.42,0:16:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Elizabeth, you serpent!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.24,0:16:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You played us false and\Nmurdered Mary anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.88,0:16:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I die this day, but my hatred for you and\Nyour wretched family will live forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.32,0:16:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse is on you, Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And thus, they went to their end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.16,0:16:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Legend has it that Tarukas'\Nneck was stiff with fury,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.74,0:16:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the headsman broke many an axe\Nbefore the task was finally done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.22,0:16:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For his part,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.54,0:16:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bluford's hair coiled around\Nthe executioner's feet,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.44,0:16:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the peerless locks\Nslicing the man's flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.66,0:16:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The story of these brave knights' betrayal\Nseems to have struck a chord with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.34,0:16:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the earth I called them to wreak\Ntheir vengeance all these centuries later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.60,0:16:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such is the power at my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.10,0:16:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In life they were fearsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.04,0:16:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In death they are invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.76,0:16:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have sworn fealty to Lord Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.78,0:16:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have come to lay waste to this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.26,0:17:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a place without redemption.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.98,0:17:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hate they felt when they\Ndied, it had 300 years to ferment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.14,0:17:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio's turned the flower of\Nknighthood into vengeful monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.68,0:17:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your wits about you, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.64,0:17:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hormone within me, come to my aid!
