Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.96,0:17:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that power!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looks so calm, but I know\Nthey ain't far from his thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.24,0:17:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that he's lost, and\Nwhat he's rediscovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.12,0:17:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Godspeed, you brave bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.32,0:17:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Methinks this boy is\Na champion of his day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.82,0:17:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He shall make the perfect target upon\Nwhich to practice the art of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.04,0:17:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's flesh belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.02,0:17:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.04,0:17:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can smell his delicious\Ncartilage already. Another zombie?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.96,0:18:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is our foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.78,0:18:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get thee gone from here, you gluttony.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.28,0:18:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He moves with infernal speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.12,0:18:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Milord Dio, in this young man I do\Nsense a great reservoir of spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.98,0:18:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I humbly petition you for the right to face\Nhim in soul combat and strike him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.98,0:18:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you will then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.84,0:18:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tarkus, this one here's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.26,0:18:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Bluford the Black Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.96,0:18:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was known to be a flawless fighter\Nand he was utterly devoid of mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.02,0:18:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just watching him put one\Nfoot in front of the other,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.68,0:18:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell he's no one to tangle with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.80,0:18:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back in my school days, we learned\Nabout this man, he and Tarkus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.22,0:18:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, he returns from\Nthe dead to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.96,0:18:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax your muscles, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.90,0:18:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathe steadily, no matter what!
