Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.52,0:18:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.62,0:18:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got both hands behind his back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.58,0:19:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bluford is giving nothing away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one is his sword arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.58,0:19:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.49,0:19:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His hair wields the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.76,0:19:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.90,0:19:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've a keen eye, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.88,0:19:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hair's dance macabre has\Nclaimed many. Have at thee!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.32,0:19:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoujo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.18,0:19:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.34,0:19:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's at a serious disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.36,0:19:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No air to breathe means no harmone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.66,0:19:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.98,0:19:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now, this brute?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.64,0:19:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, he needs us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.12,0:19:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we can't lift a finger to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.16,0:19:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.07,0:19:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo's as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.58,0:19:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't touch Blueford underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.88,0:19:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.06,0:19:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, there is nothing left to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.36,0:19:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, I will transform this\Nsleepy village into a necropolis!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.90,0:19:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The zombies I create will devour England
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.04,0:19:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like a plague with the\Nworld soon to follow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.30,0:20:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.26,0:20:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to generate hormone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.24,0:20:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a single breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.16,0:20:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, boy, and make for\Nthe surface if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.88,0:20:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suffer not for want of air,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.90,0:20:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but my armor leaves me sorely\Nencumbered under the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.10,0:20:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A duel between heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.84,0:20:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're lucky, you\Ncan beat me to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.92,0:20:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, you'll drown if you tarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.24,0:20:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,act, and quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.80,0:20:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.30,0:20:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will I just get dragged down to my doom?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.98,0:20:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get one chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.18,0:20:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As death readied himself\Nfor another victim,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.82,0:20:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo felt a wellspring\Nof resolve burst forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.08,0:20:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His lungs screaming for breath,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.24,0:20:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an ordinary man would mindlessly\Nclaw his way towards the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.48,0:20:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Jojo knew better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.38,0:20:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead, he turned and swam\Ndown, deeper into the abyss.
