Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.24,0:20:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.16,0:20:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going deeper down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.68,0:21:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.82,0:21:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Danny's grabbed hold of your toy\Npistol and won't give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.96,0:21:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trying to take it away from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.04,0:21:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.42,0:21:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Change your strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.98,0:21:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try giving it to him instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.04,0:21:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're Night's Lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.60,0:21:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a coal mining town.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.30,0:21:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means collapsed\Ntunnels and sunken earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.44,0:21:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.72,0:21:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm right, there should be air\Ntrapped underneath these rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.18,0:21:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.46,0:21:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With just one breath, my blood\Nis generating hormone again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.50,0:21:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
