Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.34,0:22:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.10,0:22:08.60,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.60,0:22:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The words will make you out or not?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.60,0:22:12.14,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The words will make you out 'n' out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.12,0:22:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You spent the day your way.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.14,0:22:17.40,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,We spend the day your way
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.40,0:22:19.99,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.42,0:22:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calling money while you feel the sun.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.99,0:22:23.74,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,In and out the valley... hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.08,0:22:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in and out the valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.52,0:22:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In and out the lake.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.74,0:22:26.16,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,In and around the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.24,0:22:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moms come out of the sky.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.41,0:22:29.45,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.45,0:22:31.37,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,and they stand there
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.68,0:22:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We stand there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.24,0:22:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why might I know we'll be there?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.46,0:22:38.13,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,One mile over we'll be there and we'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.54,0:22:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.66,0:22:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you say that we'll be there?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.76,0:22:44.30,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Ten true summers we'll be there and laughing too
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.90,0:22:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be there too.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.10,0:22:50.77,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Twenty four before my love you'll see I'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.20,0:22:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,24 before I let you sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.90,0:22:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.77,0:22:54.73,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,There with you
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.77,0:22:54.73,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,there with you
